{"message":"Use the product warranty reserve movement evidence: 2005 ending reserve $4 million; 2006 pretax warranty charges $4 million; warranty obligations assumed in 2006 acquisitions $7 million; 2006 cash outlays $5 million. The ending 2006 reserve is 4 + 4 + 7 - 5 = 10, so the change from 2005 is 10 - 4 = 6. I am calculating the equivalent net movement: charges + acquisitions - cash outlays = 4 + 7 - 5.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"(beg + charges + assumed - outlays) - beg","variables":{"beg":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"},"charges":{"value":4,"source":"source:q12n3","unit":"USD_million"},"assumed":{"value":7,"source":"source:q14n0","unit":"USD_million"},"outlays":{"value":5,"source":"source:q13n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"beg":"source:q11n4","charges":"source:q12n3","assumed":"source:q14n0","outlays":"source:q13n0"}}}